Actually, I don't think this is rather a valuable lesson for you than a
stupid way to die.  It is well-known that wielding a cockatrice corpse is
very dangerous.  It is stated in the spoiler and rumors file, but still I
think everyone who played hack had a similar experience like yours at least
once.  I am strongly against wielding a cockatrice corpse unless it is
alsolutely necessary, because:

1. Not only the staircases, but you also have to watch for the trapdoors,
   pits, etc.

2. When you kill with cockatrise corpse, monsters turn into stones not
   leaving the juicy coprses you can gain intrinsics from.

To me, the stupid way to die is the death you can hardly avoid because it
happened because of the radomness of the game.  Once I quaffed from the
fountain, and it overflowed all over the room.  I got out of the room
avoiding the waters, but I stepped on the teleport trap and got teleported
right on top of the water where I was drowned to death...


